@startuml
title NOTIFY — Email Notification

skinparam dpi 300
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #CBD5E1
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ActorBorderColor #3B82F6
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam QueueBorderColor #A855F7
skinparam QueueBackgroundColor #FAF5FF

hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Hiring Domain" as Domain
control "EmailNotificationService" as Service
database "Tenant DB (MySQL)" as TenantDB
queue "RabbitMQ notify-email" as RabbitMQ
control "EmailWorker" as Worker
control "TenantJobExecutor" as Executor
entity "SMTP provider" as Smtp

note over Domain, Service
  Preconditions: tenant ACTIVE; dispatcher already decided
  this recipient should receive email for a recruitment type.
  Retry/DLQ is out of scope. OTP is AUTH.
end note

== Enqueue ==

Domain -> Service: enqueue(SendEmailCommand)
activate Domain
activate Service
Service -> TenantDB: Load email preference for user and type
activate TenantDB
TenantDB --> Service: Preference or default enabled
deactivate TenantDB

alt Email disabled for this type
  Service --> Domain: Skip (no outbox)
  deactivate Service
  deactivate Domain
else Email allowed
  Service -> TenantDB: Load MailTemplate(type, locale)
  activate TenantDB
  TenantDB --> Service: Subject/body templates (en / vi / ja)
  deactivate TenantDB
  Service -> Service: Render subject and body (no extra PII)
  Service -> TenantDB: INSERT email_outbox PENDING attempts=0
  activate TenantDB
  TenantDB --> Service: Outbox id
  deactivate TenantDB
  Service -> RabbitMQ: publish (outboxId, X-Tenant-ID)
  activate RabbitMQ
  RabbitMQ --> Service: Accepted
  deactivate RabbitMQ
  Service --> Domain: Enqueued
  deactivate Service
  deactivate Domain

  == Deliver (first attempt succeeds) ==

  RabbitMQ -> Worker: onNotifyEmail(payload, X-Tenant-ID)
  activate Worker
  Worker -> Executor: execute(tenantId, sendTask)
  activate Executor
  Executor -> Executor: requireActive tenant; setCurrentTenant
  Executor -> TenantDB: Load PENDING outbox row
  activate TenantDB
  TenantDB --> Executor: Outbox
  deactivate TenantDB
  Executor -> Smtp: Send rendered mail
  activate Smtp
  Smtp --> Executor: 250 OK
  deactivate Smtp
  Executor -> TenantDB: UPDATE status=SENT, sent_at=now()
  activate TenantDB
  TenantDB --> Executor: Saved
  deactivate TenantDB
  Executor -> Executor: clear TenantContext
  Executor --> Worker: Done
  deactivate Executor
  Worker --> RabbitMQ: Ack
  deactivate Worker
end

note over TenantDB, Smtp
  Queue notify.email / notify.email.q exists in RabbitMqConfig.
  EmailWorker is conceptual (no @RabbitListener yet).
  Failed attempts are modelled in notification-delivery-reliability.
end note

@enduml
